      "content_markdown": "**উদাহরণ ৮.** $x$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর: ক) $\\log_{10}x = -2$ খ) $\\log_x 324 = 4$",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
    {
      "section_no": null,
      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "**সমাধান:**\nক) $\\log_{10}x = -2$\nবা, $x = 10^{-2} = \\frac{1}{10^2} = \\frac{1}{100} = 0.01$\n$$\\therefore x = 0.01$$\nখ) $\\log_x 324 = 4$\nবা, $x^4 = 324 = 3 \\times 3 \\times 3 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 2 = 3^4 \\times 2^2$\nবা, $x^4 = 3^4 \\times (\\sqrt{2})^4$\nবা, $x^4 = (3\\sqrt{2})^4$\n$$\\therefore x = 3\\sqrt{2}$$",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
    {
      "section_no": null,
      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "**উদাহরণ ৯.** প্রমাণ কর যে, $3\\log_{10}2 + \\log_{10}5 = \\log_{10}40$",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
    {
      "section_no": null,
      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "**সমাধান:** বামপক্ষ $= 3\\log_{10}2 + \\log_{10}5$\n$= \\log_{10}2^3 + \\log_{10}5 \\quad [\\because \\log_a M^r = r\\log_a M]$\n$= \\log_{10}8 + \\log_{10}5$\n$= \\log_{10}(8 \\times 5) \\quad [\\because \\log_a(MN) = \\log_a M + \\log_a N]$\n$= \\log_{10}40 = \\text{ডানপক্ষ (প্রমাণিত)}$",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
